graph TD
    User[用户] -->|交互| VC[视图组件<br/>ButtonCellComponent<br/>CheckboxCellRenderer等]
    
    VC -->|发布事件| EB[事件总线<br/>EventBus]
    
    EB -->|事件通知| EBH[事件处理器<br/>GridEventBusHandler]
    EB -->|事件通知| UI[其他UI组件<br/>日志记录/通知等]
    
    EBH -->|调用API| GA[Grid API<br/>实际业务逻辑]
    
    GA -->|状态变更| DM[数据模型<br/>RowNodes]
    
    GA -->|完成操作后| EB2[事件总线]
    
    EB2 -->|状态变更事件| VC2[视图组件<br/>UI更新]
    
    subgraph 事件类型
        gda[gridDataAction<br/>数据操作意图]
        gdc[gridDataChanged<br/>数据已变更]
        gca[gridCellAction<br/>单元格操作]
        gsc[gridSelectionChanged<br/>选择状态变更]
        gua[gridUIAction<br/>界面操作]
    end
    
    classDef componentNode fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#4fc3f7,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef eventNode fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#ffca28,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef apiNode fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#66bb6a,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef modelNode fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#ab47bc,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef typeNode fill:#ede7f6,stroke:#7e57c2,stroke-width:1px;
    
    class VC,VC2,UI componentNode;
    class EB,EB2 eventNode;
    class EBH,GA apiNode;
    class DM modelNode;
    class gda,gdc,gca,gsc,gua typeNode; 